  "body": "Character, charm and elevated living come together to deliver this wonderful family home in a sought after Bays location.\r\n\r\nPerched on the northern side of Coates Avenue, this solid brick and weatherboard home enjoys an elevated position, with beautiful sea views, abundant sunshine and mature established trees creating a peaceful, private retreat.\r\n\r\nLovingly maintained, this is a home where you can simply move in, settle down and enjoy the space around you.\r\n\r\nWith a second living room upstairs and a separate bedroom alongside, there is the perfect retreat for family and friends coming to stay. A home made for bringing people together and creating treasured memories.\r\n\r\nThe sunny deck is perfect for entertaining or relaxing while taking in the sea views. Whether it's summer gatherings or quiet winter evenings at home around the wood burner, this property offers the best of both worlds.\r\n\r\nGetting into the city could not be easier with the 76 bus and the new City Rail Link connecting from Orakei Bay Village. \r\nFrom Okahu Bay and Bastion Point to Mission Bay, Kohimarama and St Heliers, you're perfectly placed to enjoy the very best of coastal Auckland, all just moments from your doorstep.\r\n\r\nZoned for sought after Orakei School and Selwyn College, this is an appealing choice for families looking to put down roots.\r\n\r\nLovingly enjoyed by its current owners, this is more than just a home; pack up your belongings, move in and start living the good life, surrounded by everything that makes the Bays so special.",
